{"Authors":{"Names":["晏几道"],"AuthorIds":[27313],"Dynasties":["Song"]},"ShiData":[{"Id":197763,"GroupIndex":2,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"真","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"少年游"},"TuneId":{"Id":186},"Clauses":[{"Content":"西溪丹杏，"},{"Content":"波前媚脸，"},{"Content":"珠露与深匀。"},{"Content":"南桥翠柳，"},{"Content":"烟中愁黛，"},{"Content":"丝雨恼娇颦。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"当年此处，"},{"Content":"闻歌殢酒，"},{"Content":"曾对可怜人。"},{"Content":"今夜相思，"},{"Content":"水长山远，"},{"Content":"闲卧送残春。"}]},{"Id":197764,"GroupIndex":3,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"0","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"少年游"},"TuneId":{"Id":186},"Clauses":[{"Content":"离多最是，"},{"Content":"东西流水，"},{"Content":"终解两相逢。"},{"Content":"浅情终似，"},{"Content":"行云无定，"},{"Content":"犹到梦魂中。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"可怜人意，"},{"Content":"薄于云水，"},{"Content":"佳会更难重。"},{"Content":"细想从来，"},{"Content":"断肠多处，"},{"Content":"不与者番同。"}],"Comments":[{"Content":"此词抒离别怨情，上片分写云、水，以水虽离多而终能相逢、云虽无定犹能到梦中，为下片反衬作好铺垫。过片总云、水言之而又能翻进一层，说人意薄于云水。开篇先以双水分流设喻 ：“离多最是，东西流水 。”以流水喻诀别，其语本于传为卓文君被弃所作的《白头吟 》：“躞蹀御沟上，沟水东西流。”第三句却略反其意，说水分东西，终会再流到一处，等于说流水不足喻两情的诀别 ，第一层比喻便自行取消。于是再设一喻：“浅情终似，行云无定。”用行云无凭喻对方一去杳无信息，似更妥贴。不意下句又暗用楚王梦神女“朝为行云”之典，谓行云虽无凭准，还能入梦 ，将第二个比喻也予取消 。短短六句，语意翻复，有柔肠百折之感。<br />过片总云、水言之而又翻进一层，言人意薄于云水 。流水行云本为无情之物，可是它们或终能相逢，或犹到梦中，似乎又并非一味无情。在苦于“佳会更难重”的人儿心目中，人情之薄远甚于云水。翻无情为有情，原是为了加倍突出人情之难堪。结拍三句直抒情怀 ，语极沉痛 ：仔细回想，过去最为伤心的时候，也不能与今番相比。此三句是抒情主人公内心世界直截了当的表露和宣泄，感情极为深沉、厚重，读来荡气回肠，一唱三叹。<br />近人夏敬观评此词 ：“云水意相对，上分述而又总之，作法变幻 。”作者在词中正是运用这种艺术手法，造成回旋往复的词境，给读者以无穷的回味。","IsComment":false}]},{"Id":197762,"GroupIndex":4,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"20","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"少年游"},"TuneId":{"Id":186},"Clauses":[{"Content":"西楼别后，"},{"Content":"风高露冷，"},{"Content":"无奈月分明。"},{"Content":"飞鸿影里，"},{"Content":"捣衣砧外，"},{"Content":"总是玉关情。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"王孙此际，"},{"Content":"山重水远，"},{"Content":"何处赋西征。"},{"Content":"金闺魂梦枉丁宁，"},{"Content":"寻尽短长亭。"}]},{"Id":197765,"GroupIndex":5,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"尤","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"少年游"},"TuneId":{"Id":186},"Clauses":[{"Content":"雕梁燕去，"},{"Content":"裁诗寄远，"},{"Content":"庭院旧风流。"},{"Content":"黄花醉了，"},{"Content":"碧梧题罢，"},{"Content":"闲卧对高秋。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"繁云破后，"},{"Content":"分明素月，"},{"Content":"凉影挂金钩。"},{"Content":"有人凝澹倚西楼，"},{"Content":"新样两眉愁。"}]},{"Id":197756,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"0","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"丑奴儿"},"TuneId":{"Id":106},"Clauses":[{"Content":"日高庭院杨花转，"},{"Content":"闇淡春风。"},{"Content":"莺语惺愡，"},{"Content":"似笑金屏昨夜空。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"娇慵未洗匀妆手，"},{"Content":"闲印斜红。"},{"Content":"新恨重重，"},{"Content":"都与年时旧意同。"}]},{"Id":197969,"GroupIndex":1,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"闲敲玉镫隋堤路，"},{"Content":"一笑开朱户。"},{"Content":"素云凝澹月婵娟，"},{"Content":"门外鸭头春水木兰船。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"吹花拾蕊嬉游惯，"},{"Content":"天与相逢晚。"},{"Content":"一声长笛倚楼时，"},{"Content":"应恨不题红叶寄相思。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197966,"GroupIndex":2,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"飞花自有牵情处，"},{"Content":"不向枝边坠。"},{"Content":"随风飘荡已堪愁，"},{"Content":"更伴东流流水过秦楼。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"楼中翠黛含春怨，"},{"Content":"闲倚阑干见。"},{"Content":"远弹双泪惜香红，"},{"Content":"暗恨玉颜光景与花同。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197968,"GroupIndex":3,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"曲阑干外天如水，"},{"Content":"昨夜还曾倚。"},{"Content":"初将明月比佳期，"},{"Content":"长向月圆时候望人归。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"罗衣着破前香在，"},{"Content":"旧意谁教改。"},{"Content":"一春离恨懒调弦，"},{"Content":"犹有两行闲泪宝筝前。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}],"Comments":[{"Content":"此为怀人怨别词。词中以浅近而真挚的语言，回旋往复地抒写了词人心中短暂的欢乐和无法摆脱的悲哀，寄托了词人在落拓不堪的人生境遇中对于人情冷暖、世态炎凉、身世浮沉的深沉感慨。词中着意刻画的女子形象，隐然蕴含作者自伤幽独之感。<br />词的上片描述女主人公倚阑望月、盼人归来之情。<br />起首两句主写倚阑，而写今夕倚阑，却从“昨夜曾倚”见出，同样一句词，内涵容量便增加一倍不止。——既然连夜皆倚阑而望 ，当还有多少个如“昨夜”者！<br />“天如水”，比喻夜空如水般明澈与清凉，可是其意不在于写天 ，而在于以明净的天空引出皓洁的明月。歇拍两句写女主人公的对月怀人。男子去后一直不回来，也没说准什么时候回来，她结想成痴，就相信了传统的或当时流行的说法——月圆人团圆，每遇月圆，就倚阑苦望 。词中写女主人公倚阑看月 ，从希望到绝望 ，有其独到之处。“初将”是说“本将 ”，这一语汇，便已含有“后却不然”的意味。下面却跳过这层意思，径写“长望 ”，其中自有一而再、再而三以至多次的希望和失望的交替在不言之中 。“初 ”字起，“长”字承转，两个要紧的字眼，括尽一时期以来望月情事，从中烘托出女主人公的痴情和怨意。<br />词的下片抒写女子不幸被弃之恨，与上片的真诚信托、痴情等待形成强烈的反差。过片两句，从等待无望而终于悟知痴想成虚 。“罗衣著破 ”，是时长日久；“前香在”，则以罗衣前香之犹存比喻往日欢情的温馨难忘 ，委婉表达对旧情的缱绻眷恋。“旧意谁教改 ”？问语怨意颇深。人情易变，不如前香之尚在；易散之香比人情还要持久，词中女主人公感到深深的痛苦。结拍二句，点出全词的“离恨”主旨，以“一春”写离恨的时间久长，以“懒调弦”、“两行闲泪”形容离恨的悲苦之深 ，将愁极无聊之感抒写到极致。<br />春日本为芳思缠绵之时，然而日日为离恨所苦，自然无心调弦弹筝，然而又百无聊赖，于是不得不对着筝弦黯然神伤。这种内心的苦恨，被作者表现得维妙维肖。陈延焯谓“北宋晏小山工于言情”，确然不错。<br />此词运笔有迥环往复之妙 ，读之使人心魂摇荡，低徊不已。","IsComment":false}]},{"Id":197962,"GroupIndex":4,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"疏梅月下歌金缕，"},{"Content":"忆共文君语。"},{"Content":"更谁情浅似春风，"},{"Content":"一夜满枝新绿替残红。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"蘋香已有莲开信，"},{"Content":"两桨佳期近。"},{"Content":"采莲时节定来无，"},{"Content":"醉后满身花影倩人扶。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197965,"GroupIndex":5,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"玉箫吹遍烟花路，"},{"Content":"小谢经年去。"},{"Content":"更教谁画远山眉，"},{"Content":"又是陌头风细恼人时。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"时光不解年年好，"},{"Content":"叶上秋声早。"},{"Content":"可怜蝴蝶易分飞，"},{"Content":"只有杏梁双燕每来归。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197964,"GroupIndex":6,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"秋风不似春风好，"},{"Content":"一夜金英老。"},{"Content":"更谁来凭曲阑干，"},{"Content":"惟有雁边斜月照关山。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"双星旧约年年在，"},{"Content":"笑尽人情改。"},{"Content":"有期无定是无期，"},{"Content":"说与小云新恨也低眉。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197961,"GroupIndex":7,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"小梅枝上东君信，"},{"Content":"雪后花期近。"},{"Content":"南枝开尽北枝开，"},{"Content":"长被陇头游子寄春来。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"年年衣袖年年泪，"},{"Content":"总为今朝意。"},{"Content":"问谁同是忆花人。"},{"Content":"赚得小鸿眉黛也低颦。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197963,"GroupIndex":8,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"湿红笺纸回纹字，"},{"Content":"多少柔肠事。"},{"Content":"去年双燕欲归时，"},{"Content":"还是碧云千里锦书迟。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"南楼风月长依旧，"},{"Content":"别恨无端有。"},{"Content":"倩谁横笛倚危阑，"},{"Content":"今夜落梅声里怨关山。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197967,"GroupIndex":9,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"虞美人"},"TuneId":{"Id":271},"Clauses":[{"Content":"一弦弹尽仙韶乐，"},{"Content":"曾破千金学。"},{"Content":"玉楼银烛夜深深，"},{"Content":"愁见曲中双泪落千金。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}],"BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"从来不奈离声怨，"},{"Content":"几度朱弦断。"},{"Content":"未知谁解赏新音，"},{"Content":"长是好风明月暗知心。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":6}]}]},{"Id":197846,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"灰","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"采桑子"},"TuneId":{"Id":106},"Clauses":[{"Content":"花前独占春风早，"},{"Content":"长爱江梅。"},{"Content":"秀艳清杯，"},{"Content":"芳意先愁凤管催。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"寻香已落闲人后，"},{"Content":"此恨难裁。"},{"Content":"更晚须来，"},{"Content":"却恐初开胜未开。"}]},{"Id":197854,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"0","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"采桑子"},"TuneId":{"Id":106},"Clauses":[{"Content":"昭华凤管知名久，"},{"Content":"长闭帘栊。"},{"Content":"闻道春慵，"},{"Content":"方倚庭花晕脸红。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"可怜金谷无人后，"},{"Content":"此会相逢。"},{"Content":"三弄临风，"},{"Content":"送得当筵玉盏空。"}]},{"Id":197855,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"12","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"采桑子"},"TuneId":{"Id":106},"Clauses":[{"Content":"秋千散后朦胧月，"},{"Content":"满院人闲。"},{"Content":"几处雕阑。"},{"Content":"一夜风吹杏粉残。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"昭阳殿里春衣就，"},{"Content":"金缕初乾。"},{"Content":"莫信朝寒。"},{"Content":"明日花前试舞看。"}]},{"Id":197960,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"0","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"满庭芳"},"TuneId":{"Id":518},"Clauses":[{"Content":"南苑吹花，"},{"Content":"西楼题叶，"},{"Content":"故园欢事重重。"},{"Content":"凭阑秋思，"},{"Content":"闲记旧相逢。"},{"Content":"几处歌云梦雨，"},{"Content":"可怜便流水西东。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":3}]},{"Content":"别来久，"},{"Content":"浅情未有，"},{"Content":"锦字系征鸿。","BreakAfter":"1"},{"Content":"年光还少味，"},{"Content":"开残槛菊，"},{"Content":"落尽溪桐。"},{"Content":"漫留得，"},{"Content":"尊前淡月西风。"},{"Content":"此恨谁堪共说，"},{"Content":"清愁付绿酒杯中。","Comments":[{"Content":"、","Type":"Text","Index":3}]},{"Content":"佳期在，"},{"Content":"归时待把，"},{"Content":"香袖看啼红。"}]},{"Id":197851,"GroupIndex":3,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"晏几道","AuthorId":27313,"Type":"词","TypeDetail":"Ci","Rhyme":"10","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"采桑子"},"TuneId":{"Id":106},"Clauses":[{"Cont